   "file_text": "# Long-Run Estimates of Ice-Shelf Acoustics\n# version: Version of Record, Transactions on Sparse Inference (2024)\nentity,median_latency\nN-26,30.8\nS-12,95.0\nB-04,68.6\nM-09,125.7\nL-08,339.2\n",
